---
name: __PROJECT_NAME__-development
description: Extend the __PROJECT_NAME__ Maximus project with routes, MCP tools and tests that follow its conventions.
---

Read CLAUDE.md and the Maximus skill (.agents/skills/maximus/SKILL.md) before changing the project.

- Add a route with `bunx maximus gen route <method> <path>`, then fill in its handler and its strict input
  and output schemas. Declare a scope or effect only where the method's default is wrong, and `mcp` or `rpc`
  only to expose the route there.
- Add a tool only agents use with `bunx maximus gen tool <name>`, in mcp/tools/.
- Put domain logic in named functions under src/, and what every handler needs in context.ts.
- Answer expected failures with `fail(code)` from the catalog in errors.ts, declared in `failures`.
- Cover each route in tests/ through `handler` from #maximus/http, including its refusals.
- Run `bun run verify` before you finish. Never edit .maximus/; cloud resources and SQL stay explicit.
